{
  "caption_latex": "\\textbf{The goal is accurate forecasts with fewer additional interactions.} The quarter-budget graph retains every native edge and only a quarter of the optional additions shown in the dense graph (schematic; self-messages omitted). The cards separate training, placement on matched observed test histories, and autonomous feedback. Triplets show seeds 0, 1, and 2 for each named contrast; negative means lower error or a smaller risk-minus-random gap. The cross retains Goop's undefined full-horizon interaction.",
  "dimensions_pt": [
    470,
    238
  ],
